= Norman St John-Stevas

[? if con_in_government = 0 : Shadow Leader of the House and education spokesman. ?][? if con_in_government = 1 : Leader of the House of Commons and Minister for the Arts. ?] Witty, theatrical and devoutly Catholic, he calls you "the Blessed Margaret" and "the Leaderene", and you are not always sure he means it kindly.

- @parents
- @charm
- @select_committees
- @arts
- @root: Return

@parents
title: Champion parents in education
view-if: con_in_government = 0
subtitle: White-collar voters warm to us.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; c1_con += 2*(1-dissent); c2_con += 1*(1-dissent); labour_credibility -= 1

St John-Stevas publishes a Parents' Charter promising choice of school, published exam results and a say on governing bodies.

@charm
title: Charm the House
subtitle: Calms the party, and the backbenches in government.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; wet_dissent -= 3; loyalist_dissent -= 2; rebellion -= 1 if con_in_government

A performance at the dispatch box that has the whole House laughing, Labour included. For a week or two, tempers cool.

@select_committees
title: Create the select committees
view-if: con_in_government = 1 and select_committees = 0
subtitle: Parliament gains power to scrutinise ministers. The backbenches and the Liberals approve.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; select_committees = 1; lib_relation += 3; rebellion -= 1; wet_dissent -= 3; loyalist_dissent += 1
achievement: select_committees

Every government department will now be shadowed by a committee of backbenchers with the power to call ministers and civil servants. Whitehall is appalled. St John-Stevas calls it the most important reform of the Commons this century.

@arts
title: Protect the arts budget
view-if: con_in_government = 1
subtitle: -0.5 budget. The professional classes approve.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
unavailable-subtitle: [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next action.
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; last_advisor_action = 1; budget -= 0.5; ab_con += 1*(1-dissent); c1_con += 1*(1-dissent); wet_dissent -= 2

The Arts Council grant survives the spending round intact. The Royal Opera House sends its thanks; the Treasury sends a memo.
